(7663519, 1248985, 135744, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. <br/> <br/>Just a few comments if you don''t mind. I felt the shadows were rather harsh and it was difficult to see the details of the ingredients however I am very impressed how you separated the floating pie elements. The black background and white work surface seem rather harsh too and I wonder if a more natural setting would have worked better.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon.  Just a few comments if you don''t mind. I felt the shadows were rather harsh and it was difficult to see the details of the ingredients however I am very impressed how you separated the floating pie elements. The black background and white work surface seem rather harsh too and I wonder if a more natural setting would have worked better. ', '2020-05-22 06:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
