(7663612, 1249429, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful .. so up close and personal .. <br/>probably a bit in your face for some ppl who regard flies as annoying and pesky critters .. but they are not seeing the big picture .. <br/>loving all the details you have captured .. its quite a beautiful image .. xx</td>', 'this is wonderful .. so up close and personal .. probably a bit in your face for some ppl who regard flies as annoying and pesky critters .. but they are not seeing the big picture .. loving all the details you have captured .. its quite a beautiful image .. xx', '2020-05-22 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7663614, 1249358, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Going uphill is a sweaty business! being surrounded by a pastel tonality made it less repulsive (if real, otherwise mighty interesting)  and we almost feel for it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>he was facing down in the actual photo Maricua .. and i added a much more interesting background to the actual oof green grass ..  but i wanted to imbue it with more meaning in a way .. life can be so difficult .. and it seems like we face so many up-hill hurdles .. and when you think about it .. the climb .. altho difficult at the time .. can lead to some wonderful things .. well that''s what i keep telling myself .. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Going uphill is a sweaty business! being surrounded by a pastel tonality made it less repulsive (if real, otherwise mighty interesting)  and we almost feel for it.   he was facing down in the actual photo Maricua .. and i added a much more interesting background to the actual oof green grass ..  but i wanted to imbue it with more meaning in a way .. life can be so difficult .. and it seems like we face so many up-hill hurdles .. and when you think about it .. the climb .. altho difficult at the time .. can lead to some wonderful things .. well that''s what i keep telling myself .. :)', '2020-05-22 20:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
